Mish Mash is the game having a little fun at their expense.]

>ask ford about the mish mash
"The Mish Mash," says Ford, with the weariness of a man who has stopped trying
to explain things. "It's what you call everything when you can't be bothered to
separate it. Possible, impossible and what was for lunch. Don't try to sort it.
It dislikes being sorted."

